From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Translate the 2D replica eye selector (ORDER 763)

--- a/po/pl/kcm_kscreen.po
+++ b/po/pl/kcm_kscreen.po
@@ -1474,3 +1474,12 @@
 msgctxt "@item:inlistbox A custom mode, and that it uses reduced blanking timings"
 msgid "%1, reduced blanking"
 msgstr "%1, skrócone wygaszanie"
+
+msgctxt "@info Explanation of the per-screen eye selector"
+msgid "Exchange the views on this screen. A 2D screen shows the right eye of the shared 3D desktop when this is enabled. Correct a wrongly marked file in the program's own 3D menu."
+msgstr "Zamień widoki na tym ekranie. Po włączeniu tej opcji ekran 2D pokazuje prawe oko wspólnego pulpitu 3D. Nieprawidłowo oznaczony plik popraw w menu 3D programu."
+
+msgctxt "@info Reason why the eye selector is disabled"
+msgid "3D is not active for this screen."
+msgstr "Tryb 3D nie jest aktywny na tym ekranie."
+
